{"tmdb":1616861,"tagline":"","synopsis":"Rosa, a contemporary music composer, agrees to give her first television interview at her colleague Tere’s apartment to keep it secret from her husband. What begins as a simple professional conversation turns into an absurd and comic portrait of rivalries and affections among three women—Rosa, Tere, and Tere’s daughter Luisa—interrupted by power outages, a constantly barking dog, and the visit of a famous composer. As the interview unravels, family and artistic tensions surface, revealing, with humor, both the fragility of prestige and the strength of complicity.","directors":[{"name":"Nicolás Pereda","id":1021436}],"cast":[{"actor":"Teresa Sánchez","role":"Tere","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/iLzgyVP822PHZCOtNFROi9YSHTJ.jpg","tmdb":1043788},{"actor":"Rosa Estela Juárez Vargas","role":"Rosa Esquivel","photo":null,"tmdb":6005954},{"actor":"Luisa Pardo","role":"Luisa Sanchez","photo":null,"tmdb":1043872},{"actor":"Gabino Rodríguez","role":"Lazaro Ibañez","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/3svt4zZsrXA4TtZ3etRqkcqDfQg.jpg","tmdb":1018056},{"actor":"Francisco Barreiro","role":"Paco","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/gTj2sXUJ7CaQnPuNqP1L3VPhE6k.jpg","tmdb":557879},{"actor":"José Rodríguez López","role":"Estevez","photo":null,"tmdb":1153491},{"actor":"Andrew Leland Rogers","role":"Vecino 1","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/uURYtlsWZbQBm2QyEvhnkreJfNy.jpg","tmdb":1432420},{"actor":"Juan Francisco Maldonado","role":"Vecino 2","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/hA3AmSvovpIZJX9K6aDHKHWZigV.jpg","tmdb":3929461},{"actor":"Rosa Estela Juárez","role":"","photo":null,"tmdb":1290796}],"trailers":[{"key":"un2N0_pkmfA","name":"Official Trailer [Subtitled]","type":"Trailer","published":"2026-09-08"}],"official":null,"watch":{},"artwork":{"posters":[["/4TlqN3wIrXgFnxNHl5hSTFqfojP.jpg",600,900],["/gILtyblgmuedpTSFm5T0cDeJwz.jpg",1600,2363],["/7ZReFyrvuckG18kIoigqtrflPBP.jpg",2000,3000],["/4an6UauGymA3XHQ6uzakeM